{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. Where the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.\n\n[[cite:obs-868447f8b88be9b9257a5075ef17182e1dd3e00a \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"8aa2e21b411ad40e2a0afe77231610b873292d47874ccef8b9aeb45e4ad3ce50","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed mention of the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to comply with the CFO directive of 1 July 2026, which takes precedence. Kept only the statement supported by the CFO directive source, with exact citation."}